  {
    "id": "cabin-security-tab",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "Cabin Intrusion Alarm",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Node-RED-native Enable, Arm Away, Disarm, and unconditional Silence controls. Alarm ON requires enabled + armed + Nate confirmed away. Disable, Disarm, Silence, and two-minute timeout all invoke repeated OFF. Presence comes from the retained MQTT topic cabin/presence/nate (not directly from person.natecabin). W-33: if the phone's last report (cabin/presence/nate/last_seen) is older than PRESENCE_STALE_HOURS (default 6), a door opening while armed sends a push alert only and never sounds the siren."
  },
